# mit-scheme-dbg is not an obsolete-style ELF debug package: the ELF debugging
# symbols go to the automatically generated mit-scheme-dbgsym.  What -dbg holds
# is MIT/GNU Scheme's own .bci files, which the Scheme debugger reads to
# describe compiled Scheme code, and for which there is no dbgsym equivalent.
